WEBVTT

00:12:29.411 --> 00:12:30.788
Three.

00:12:30.829 --> 00:12:32.331
I've given you a number of ways

00:12:32.372 --> 00:12:39.296
in which our future selves are going to be
weaker and frailer than we are today.

00:12:40.547 --> 00:12:42.966
And that is true,
that is part of the story.

00:12:42.966 --> 00:12:45.552
But it is only a part of the story.

00:12:46.303 --> 00:12:50.599
Our future selves are also going to have
capacities and strengths

00:12:50.641 --> 00:12:53.685
and wisdom that we do not possess today.

00:12:54.853 --> 00:12:58.607
So when we confront opportunities
and we hesitate,

00:12:58.607 --> 00:13:01.026
when I tell myself,
"I don't think I have it in me